      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "fr"
    },
    {
      "text": "Diagrama de clases UML del perfil Core de SPDX 3.0. La clase abstracta Element (spdxId anyURI[1], name, summary, description, comment, creationInfo CreationInfo[1], verifiedUsing IntegrityMethod[0..*], externalRef, externalIdentifier, extension) es la raíz. Agent (con las subclases Person, Organization, SoftwareAgent), Tool, Artifact (originatedBy, suppliedBy, builtTime, releaseTime, validUntilTime, standardName, supportLevel), IndividualElement, Annotation (annotationType[1], statement, contentType; subject 1 Element), Relationship (relationshipType[1], completeness, startTime, endTime; from 1 Element, to 1..* Elements) y la clase abstracta ElementCollection (profileConformance; element y rootElement) especializan Element. SpdxDocument (import ExternalMap, dataLicense, namespaceMap) y Bundle (context) especializan ElementCollection, Bom especializa Bundle y LifecycleScopedRelationship (scope) especializa Relationship. Un recuadro «Non-Element Classes» contiene CreationInfo (specVersion SemVer[1], created DateTime[1], createdBy Agent[1..*], createdUsing Tool[0..*], comment), ExternalIdentifier, ExternalMap, ExternalRef, DictionaryEntry, NamespaceMap, PositiveIntegerRange e IntegrityMethod con sus subclases Hash (algorithm, hashValue) y PackageVerificationCode. Otros dos recuadros enumeran los tipos de datos simples (DateTime, MediaType, SemVer) y las enumeraciones (AnnotationType, ExternalIdentifierType, ExternalRefType, HashAlgorithm, LifecycleScopeType, PresenceType, ProfileIdentifierType, RelationshipCompleteness, RelationshipType, SupportType).",
