      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "ar"
    },
    {
      "text": "Диаграмма классов UML профиля Core в SPDX 3.0. Корнем служит абстрактный класс Element (spdxId anyURI[1], name, summary, description, comment, creationInfo CreationInfo[1], verifiedUsing IntegrityMethod[0..*], externalRef, externalIdentifier, extension). Его специализируют Agent (с подклассами Person, Organization, SoftwareAgent), Tool, Artifact (originatedBy, suppliedBy, builtTime, releaseTime, validUntilTime, standardName, supportLevel), IndividualElement, Annotation (annotationType[1], statement, contentType; subject 1 Element), Relationship (relationshipType[1], completeness, startTime, endTime; from 1 Element, to 1..* Elements) и абстрактный ElementCollection (profileConformance; element и rootElement). SpdxDocument (import ExternalMap, dataLicense, namespaceMap) и Bundle (context) специализируют ElementCollection, Bom специализирует Bundle, а LifecycleScopedRelationship (scope) специализирует Relationship. Блок «Non-Element Classes» содержит CreationInfo (specVersion SemVer[1], created DateTime[1], createdBy Agent[1..*], createdUsing Tool[0..*], comment), ExternalIdentifier, ExternalMap, ExternalRef, DictionaryEntry, NamespaceMap, PositiveIntegerRange и IntegrityMethod с подклассами Hash (algorithm, hashValue) и PackageVerificationCode. Ещё два блока перечисляют простые типы данных (DateTime, MediaType, SemVer) и перечисления (AnnotationType, ExternalIdentifierType, ExternalRefType, HashAlgorithm, LifecycleScopeType, PresenceType, ProfileIdentifierType, RelationshipCompleteness, RelationshipType, SupportType).",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkFVzHu3LN6P5Nj2psquPU"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-10-24",
      "lang": "ru"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPDX 3.0 Core 配置文件的 UML 类图。抽象类 Element（spdxId anyURI[1]、name、summary、description、comment、creationInfo CreationInfo[1]、verifiedUsing IntegrityMethod[0..*]、externalRef、externalIdentifier、extension）是根。Agent（子类 Person、Organization、SoftwareAgent）、Tool、Artifact（originatedBy、suppliedBy、builtTime、releaseTime、validUntilTime、standardName、supportLevel）、IndividualElement、Annotation（annotationType[1]、statement、contentType；subject 1 Element）、Relationship（relationshipType[1]、completeness、startTime、endTime；from 1 Element，to 1..* Elements）以及抽象类 ElementCollection（profileConformance；element 和 rootElement）都特化 Element。SpdxDocument（import ExternalMap、dataLicense、namespaceMap）和 Bundle（context）特化 ElementCollection，Bom 特化 Bundle，LifecycleScopedRelationship（scope）特化 Relationship。“Non-Element Classes”框中有 CreationInfo（specVersion SemVer[1]、created DateTime[1]、createdBy Agent[1..*]、createdUsing Tool[0..*]、comment）、ExternalIdentifier、ExternalMap、ExternalRef、DictionaryEntry、NamespaceMap、PositiveIntegerRange，以及 IntegrityMethod 及其子类 Hash（algorithm、hashValue）和 PackageVerificationCode。另外两个框列出简单数据类型（DateTime、MediaType、SemVer）和枚举（AnnotationType、ExternalIdentifierType、ExternalRefType、HashAlgorithm、LifecycleScopeType、PresenceType、ProfileIdentifierType、RelationshipCompleteness、RelationshipType、SupportType）。",
